C.O.R.E. OS model directory

core.gguf    symlink to the language model served by core-inference.service
whisper.bin  symlink to the whisper.cpp speech model used for voice input

Models are baked into the image by image/scripts/fetch-models.sh (see
docs/MODELS.md). To switch models, point the symlink at another GGUF file and
run: systemctl restart core-inference
